# The serialized PipelineModel must survive a round-trip through git byte for
# byte. Its metadata is JSON read back through Hadoop, and the sibling .crc
# files are checksums over those exact bytes - let git convert LF to CRLF on
# checkout and the checksums no longer match, so the model fails to load on
# whichever machine cloned it. Never let these be treated as text.
models/** -text

# Figures and the JSON the report is built from: same reasoning, no diffing
# value, and PNGs must not be touched at all.
docs/benchmarks/*.png binary
docs/benchmarks/*.json -text

# Keep shell scripts LF so they still run under Git Bash / spark-submit.
*.sh text eol=lf
